  entry
    definition "a statement that solves a problem or explains how to solve the problem"
    examples ("they were trying to find a peaceful solution" "the answers were in the back of the book" "he computed the result to four decimal places")
    id oewn-06756201-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (answer result resolution solvent)
  entry
    definition "a method for solving a problem"
    examples ("the easy solution is to look it up in the handbook")
    id oewn-05669513-n
    partOfSpeech n
  entry
    definition "the set of values that give a true statement when substituted into an equation"
    id oewn-08022396-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (root)
  entry
    definition "the successful action of solving a problem"
    examples ("the solution took three hours")
